  "bodyHash": "e5f12d5b2317d16f",
  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">土豆炮弹药计数器</h1>\n<p>在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpotato-cannon-ammo-counter\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 上</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">这是我之前制作的模组 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/arrow-display\" rel=\"nofollow\">Arrow Display</a> 的衍生版本，它可以让您查看背包中箭矢的数量。此版本功能相同，但适用于 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Mod</a> 的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcreate.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fPotato_Cannon\" rel=\"nofollow\">土豆炮</a>。</p>\n<p>当您在主手或副手持有土豆炮时，准星下方会显示一个小提示</p>\n<p>其中的数字即为您当前背包中的弹药数量</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/763/674/2023-11-24_17.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"508\" height=\"286\"></p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<p>本视频中的展示：</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ocBXmDfqM9g?si=Cz2IJJGiwcP1gzD2&start=183\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>自定义设置</h2>\n<p>按 <em><strong>N</strong></em> 键，可切换显示位置为 <em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">准星下方</span></em> 或 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em>准星上方</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\">支持计数的物品：</h2>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\">原版：</h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>\"minecraft:golden_apple\",<br>\"minecraft:baked_potato\",<br>\"minecraft:carrot\",<br>\"minecraft:poisonous_potato\",<br>\"minecraft:chorus_fruit\",<br>\"minecraft:glistering_melon_slice\",<br>\"minecraft:apple\",<br>\"minecraft:glow_berries\",<br>\"minecraft:cake\",<br>\"minecraft:golden_carrot\",<br>\"minecraft:melon_slice\",<br>\"minecraft:pumpkin\",<br>\"minecraft:melon\",<br>\"minecraft:potato\",<br>\"minecraft:sweet_berries\",<br>\"minecraft:enchanted_golden_apple\",<br>\"minecraft:pumpkin_pie\",<br>\"minecraft:beetroot\"</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\">Create（机械动力）：</h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>\"create:chocolate_glazed_berries\",<br>\"create:honeyed_apple\",<br>\"create:blaze_cake\"</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\">Farmer's Delight（农夫乐事）：</h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>\"farmersdelight:cabbage\",<br>\"farmersdelight:apple_pie\",<br>\"farmersdelight:sweet_berry_cheesecake\",<br>\"farmersdelight:chocolate_pie\",<br>\"farmersdelight:cake_slice\",<br>\"farmersdelight:apple_pie_slice\",<br>\"farmersdelight:sweet_berry_cheesecake_slice\",<br>\"farmersdelight:chocolate_pie_slice\",<br>\"farmersdelight:onion\",<br>\"farmersdelight:pumpkin_slice\",<br>\"farmersdelight:rotten_tomato\",<br>\"farmersdelight:tomato\"</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ftejty\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/988472/description_99901395-cdae-402c-9e91-7f8b27c59a9d.png\" alt=\"在 Ko-fi 上支持我\" width=\"360\" height=\"48\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ftejty%252fcommissions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/988472/description_0fed605d-2021-42e5-8e2a-15e812535fe6.png\" alt=\"定制模组订单\" width=\"360\" height=\"48\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/xByznP7RHw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/988472/description_ab810526-bb00-4248-9150-47c044ec2d87.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"360\" height=\"48\"></a></p>",
